    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just the pressure though. it's like... the more i try to fix it, the more i realize there's nothing to fix. it's just how i am now. i feel like i've reached the end of a road and there's just nothing ahead of me but more of this. i'm just so done with the constant struggle to just... exist.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
